<section class="problem-section section-grid">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">The good stuff is scattered</p><h2>You should not need ten tabs to find one perfect Saturday.</h2></div>
  <div class="section-copy"><p>Great events and timely opportunities live across organizer pages, community calendars, newsletters, and ticket sites. Search only works when you remember to search—and broad alerts quickly become noise.</p><p>OnMyRadar turns a specific wish into an ongoing Radar. It checks multiple approved sources, brings duplicate listings together, and surfaces the matches worth your attention.</p></div>
</section>

